  /// Owner or Reseller user administers OTHER tenants, they are not a
  /// member of one. Real authority for such a user comes entirely from
  /// `Membership` below, not from this field. An ordinary tenant employee
  /// keeps this set exactly as before, with zero `Membership` rows - the
  /// two are independent, a person can hold both at once (e.g. a support
  /// engineer who also runs their own trial tenant).
  organizationId String?
