  ///
  /// The alternative - a separate VanStock table - would mean a second stock
  /// ledger with its own balances, its own drift and its own reconciliation
  /// against the first. Atlas already has one two-ledger problem (quantity
  /// versus identity, `03-specs/STOCK-IDENTITY-SPEC.md`); it does not need a
  /// third ledger invented on purpose.
  ///
  /// What the kind changes is REPORTING, not mechanics. Stock in a van has not
  /// left the business and still counts in stock on hand - Pravin's decision 6
  /// - but "where is it?" and "whose is it?" are questions only a van asks.
  kind String @default("store")

