  /// Dispatched so far. Enables partial dispatch without a second table.
  dispatchedQty Int @default(0)
  /// Unused, back from an installation and received into stock (22 Oct 2026,
  /// R2). Still out with the customer = dispatchedQty - returnedQty; the order's
  /// own return, cancel and invoice all count from that, so nothing comes back
  /// twice and nothing that came back is billed.
  returnedQty   Int @default(0)

  /// The AMC on this line, carried from the quotation and on to the invoice.
  /// See `InvoiceItem.amcOpted`.
  amcOpted      Boolean @default(false)
